{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wthPDOf9os1793318532.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上社交媒體Reddit第三季度業績好過市場預期，但第四季度業績指引不如預期，股價在延長交易時段曾跌約一成九。</p><p></p><p>公司季內純利2.83億美元，按年增長七成四。每股攤薄盈利1.4美元，較預期多5美仙。收入8.95億美元，較預期多1,700萬美元。期內每日活躍獨立用戶，按年增一成二，至1.3億，但低過預期的1.33億。預期第四季度經調整EBITDA，最高達5.1億美元，收入最高見10.3億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:00:58.509638+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:57:08.661197+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:58:18.650716+00:00","content_hash":"1738fc7e09b7ce30eee11435075cd4f2153fdfc927565972316b8a6edfac6451","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}